# Vraska, the Silencer: "Whenever a nontoken creature an opponent controls dies, you may pay {1}. If you do, return that card to the
# battlefield tapped under your control. It's a Treasure artifact ... and it loses all other card types" (CR 700.4, 111.7, 118.12, 205.1a).
# Turn 3 a Lightning Bolt on a Goblin token returns nothing (a token). Turn 5 a Bolt kills Bot2's Memnite and Bot1 pays {1}: it returns tapped
# as a Treasure artifact, no longer a creature, and the Treasure's own mana pays for another Bolt. Turn 7 a Bolt kills a second Memnite and
# Bot1 declines: it stays in the graveyard. A third Bolt kills the last Memnite and Bot2 exiles its graveyard with Tormod's Crypt in
# response: Bot1 pays, but the card is gone, so nothing returns.

